@startuml EdCraftAuthoring
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
hide footbox
participant "Authoring model" as Model
participant Application as App
participant "MCP checks" as Checks
App -> Checks: Discover domain tool catalogue
Checks --> App: Names, schemas, versions
App -> Model: Request, proposal schema and catalogue
Model --> App: Proposal and selected check plan
App -> App: Validate and freeze plan names and arguments
loop Initial candidate plus at most three revisions
  App -> Checks: Run selected technical checks on current candidate
  Checks --> App: Current-candidate evidence
  alt Technical prerequisites pass
    opt Difficulty selected
      App -> Checks: Assess checked template difficulty
      Checks --> App: Assessment, warning, failure or error
    end
  else Technical prerequisites fail
    App -> App: Record dependent difficulty check as skipped
  end
  alt All selected policies pass and answer evidence is available
    App -> App: Save artifact; checked; stop
  else Repairable failure with revision allowance
    App -> Model: Original request, candidate, frozen plan,\ncheck evidence and revision allowance
    Model --> App: Complete replacement proposal
    App -> App: Validate and rebuild candidate
  else No allowance, missing evidence or terminal error
    App -> App: Retain history; needs_review or error; stop
  end
end
note over App,Checks
Every replacement is checked afresh.
No author native tool call or final acknowledgement is required.
end note
@enduml
